      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINSOME WAY (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (18.74) in a Grade 5 at this track. Can make amends. ZIPPING FERLAZZO (8) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing nine from 15 starts. Filled a minor placings again last time when third (30.48) at this track making it four placings in a row. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in three starts. Will give a great sight again. OUR LITTLE SUZIE (2) is mixing form and out of the placings last time but was a Grade 5 winner three starts ago and moves to Box 2 this time where she has performed well. Has the ability and can find best this time. HELLO HILDA (6) missed out after being heavily supported last time but should feature.",
